ental health  nevada senator marilyn dondero loop  joined in on the conversation  announcing that a mental health day bill  was on the horizon  this bill would allow students to take  time off if they were dealing with any  mental challenges  different from an ordinary sick day  overall the webinar was cathartic  bringing a sense of togetherness to the  teens and adults involved  having like friends and like having this  meeting and  caroline and lauren and it's like it's  nice to  have these people around and having like  such a big support group knowing that  like i'm not alone in this  and the organization will be hosting  another webinar this thursday entitled  youth mental health talk  we of course will have more information  on our website reporting in studio  madison kimbrough  8 news now
 

